---
// Inline FTC affiliate disclosure. Rendered near the top of every article,
// above the parts tables, so it is clear, conspicuous, and proximate to the
// affiliate links (FTC 16 CFR 255 + Amazon Associates per-page requirement).
---

<aside class="affiliate-disclosure" role="note">
  <span aria-hidden="true">🔗</span>
  Some links in this guide are affiliate links. If you buy a part through them
  we may earn a small commission, at no extra cost to you. See our
  <a href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.
</aside>

<style>
  .affiliate-disclosure {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    /* Theme-aware so it passes WCAG 1.4.3 AA in BOTH light and dark: 82% of the
       max-contrast foreground over the muted background. A hardcoded gray failed
       contrast in light mode (and would fail in dark). */
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 82%, transparent);
    background: var(--muted, #f3f4f6);
    border: 1px solid var(--border, #d9d6ce);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .affiliate-disclosure a {
    /* Darken the accent toward the foreground so the link clears AA on the muted
       background (raw --accent was ~3:1 in light mode). Lightens in dark mode. */
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent, #E6531D) 72%, var(--foreground) 28%);
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
